#!/bin/sh
# Lint GitHub workflow files before they reach GitHub: a broken one fails
# in 0 s, skips its schedule and opens no "failure" issue (review A7.1,
# 2026-10-24/25). Errors and shellcheck warnings block; style notes don't.
# Enabled with: git config core.hooksPath .githooks
ls .github/workflows/*.yml >/dev/null 2>&1 || exit 0
if ! command -v actionlint >/dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo "pre-push: actionlint missing (brew install actionlint shellcheck); workflows not checked" >&2
  exit 0
fi
SHELLCHECK_OPTS="-S warning" actionlint .github/workflows/*.yml || {
  echo "pre-push: fix the workflow errors above (or push with --no-verify)" >&2
  exit 1
}
